    "body": "Not a bug, so closed. PathPilot numbers lathe tool orientations exactly as LinuxCNC's chart does in machine coordinates.\n- An OD thread on +X takes **6** and an internal thread on +X calls for **8**.\n- The OD chamfer posts with **6**.\n- PathPilot's Status-page chart is LinuxCNC's chart rotated 180° (viewed from behind), not mirrored.\n- The facing sample's orientation 3 is the Hub's untyped default T1, and PathPilot does not orientation-check facing.\n\n#640's table stands. PR #653 is closed and its branch deleted.",
